258
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Wait, it's worse than that!

259
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
He's regenerating himself extremely quickly!

260
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:50,000
It's stage zero. Well then, let me show you.

261
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:55,000
A bit of my Devil's power.

262
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
55%.

263
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:12,000
Do you see what your problem is?

264
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:22,000
But isn't that your weak? I'm just that much better.

265
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:28,000
All of this... is for the glory of the Spade Kingdom.

266
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
The destruction of Spade Kingdom!

267
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:17,000
Wait, this is...

268
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Prince Yudo!

269
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:40,000
Please, Yudo! Don't leave me! I can't live without you!

270
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
The Prince...

271
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,000
He's dead?

272
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,000
No...

273
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:04,000
It's not true! It can't be!

274
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:09,000
You can't die! Not like this!

275
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,000
A tree? How?

276
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,000
How?

277
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
It's so... huge!

278
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:47,000
I know this smell!

279
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:53,000
That's... the Captain's magic!

280
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,000
No!

281
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,000
No!

282
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,000
Yudo!

283
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,000
No!

284
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Please, goodness!

285
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,000
I'm fine!

286
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,000
You scared me!

287
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,000
Close?

288
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Somehow, we're still alive!

289
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:44,000
This is Lord Fongens' world tree magic, and he was wounded so severely!

290
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:48,000
He must have used all the strength he had to save us!

291
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Has anyone seen the Captain?

292
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,000
No way!

293
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,000
No way! There's no way he's been taken!

294
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
Survive, Lord Fongens!

295
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Where are the others?

296
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Sheeran?

297
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,000
Sheeran, he's dead!

298
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Oh, no, please, no!

299
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Oh.

300
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,000
An man...

301
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:25,900
He saved so many of us from dying.

302
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:31,540
But even his magic couldn't bring back the people who were already dead.

303
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:39,540
Half of our squad was killed.

304
00:21:41,540 --> 00:21:42,420
Damn it.

305
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:47,060
I should have been stronger.

306
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Run!

307
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:24,500
静かにそっと

308
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:31,580
ほら新たな日々が始まる

309
00:22:31,580 --> 00:22:36,380
胸にしまい込んだままの

310
00:22:36,380 --> 00:22:39,460
想いを解き放って

311
00:22:39,460 --> 00:22:44,080
その翼を広げて

312
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:50,080
今飛び立て

313
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:54,080
あの海原を見下ろして

314
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:57,080
誰よりも遠く

315
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:59,080
何度でも

316
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:01,080
Will you fly?

317
00:23:01,080 --> 00:23:04,080
beautiful

318
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:08,080
どんな景色も

319
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:12,080
君といれば輝くよ

320
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:16,080
だからずっとそばにいて

321
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:19,080
and never let go

322
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:22,080
僕のこの手を

323
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:23,080
離れよ

324
00:23:23,080 --> 00:23:25,080
離さないで

325
00:23:25,080 --> 00:23:27,080
どこまでも

326
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:30,080
ついてきてほしい

327
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:34,080
The world is so beautiful

328
00:23:36,080 --> 00:23:38,080
This is only the prologue.

329
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:40,080
Once our objective comes to fruition

330
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:43,080
all of you will be plunged into profound misery.

331
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:46,080
Black Clover page 162

332
00:23:46,080 --> 00:23:49,080
The Great War breaks out.

333
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:54,080
.

